{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_08_end","storyGroup":"act40side","storySort":16,"storyDependence":"act40side_level_act40side_08_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OR-8","storyName":"金玉藏心\n","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"煌和行箸终于知道了彼此的身世。煌决定直接面见真龙，为所有人要一个说法。小大厨提起食盒，准备去见一位特殊的客人。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act40side/level_act40side_08_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act40side_08","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":14,"next":16,"characters":["宁述","虞澄","煌","宁茵","小大厨","老姜","余","巡逻的卫兵","“禁军小教头”","？？？"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"虞澄......你想要的，当年太师案的真相，就是这样。","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"你还有什么想问的？","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"说了这么多，宁大人倒是只字不提，自己在这一系列事件中的位置。","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"......你为什么要派人刺杀刑部尚书？","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"虞少卿不是已经有答案了吗？许多年前，你不是指控我在乱局中为求自保，便派人谋害了查案的刑部尚书吗？","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"宁大人倒不必急着这样抹黑自己。","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"其实这个问题也困扰了我很久，顾筌时隔十几年再回到百灶，为何偏偏留在你的家中？","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"直到那一次，我在你家看到那个女孩，我的最后一个问题才得到解答。","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"顾筌九死一生，还是要回到百灶，不只是为了查明当年真相，也是为了找到，自己遗落在百灶的女儿。","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"看来顾筌告诉你的事，似乎也没有那么多。","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"是啊，剩下的事，都只是我的猜想，要是有不对的地方，宁大人大可笑话我。","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"我听说，当年太师背负谋逆之罪自尽后，举国哗然，文武百官纷纷表态与太师割席。可是有一个学宫的学生，竟敢当众上门凭吊太师。","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"也因此，他撞见了太师被抄家的场面。慌乱中，他只得带走了太师家中一个出生不久的女婴——巧的是，他自己的女儿也刚刚出世。","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"他不知所措，带着妻子和两个婴儿想要逃离百灶，可他不过是一个势单力薄的书生，没过多久，就被赶来的禁军抓到。","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"大概是那位禁军心存恻隐，也是有意为太师保留血脉，放了那书生一条生路，带回了那个书生的孩子。","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"我不知顾筌该作何想，不过当时的他大概也别无选择。","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"这个孩子落在刑部尚书手中，她的血脉一查便知，可如何处理这个本是局外人的孩子反而成了悬而未决的难题。","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"就在这个时候，对于刑部尚书过激之举早有不满的宁大人，终于选择铤而走险，派人刺杀了刑部尚书。","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"太师案牵连甚广，手上沾满了血的刑部尚书遭人报复似乎也在情理之中，时局既定，真龙便默许这一系列风波以这种方式落下帷幕。","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"那最后没有解决的问题，也只剩下了那个孩子。从结果来看，她既然被宁大人收养，其中过程，似乎也不难猜。但要说目的......","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"宁大人，我没记错的话，你也在太师门下读过书，对吧？","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"......虞澄啊虞澄，你要是不在大理寺为官，你要是不在这狱中，我真不敢想，你这样的心计，还能做出什么事来。","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"可怕，真可怕......","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"宁大人过奖了，和顾筌比起来，我不过是个笨人。只是当这大理寺少卿，见过太多人了——见多了，也就懂了。","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"现在想起来，顾筌在百珍宴上为真龙献上那道菜，近乎求死之举，实际上是已经与真相和解。","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"而他在临死前，没有告诉我真相，却向我透露了太师遗孤的下落——他是希望我查明真相后，也能选择和解。","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"......可我和解不了。","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"我只能用这种方式，找到那些留下的人、你在乎的人，逼你把真相吐出来。","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"宁大人，细算来，你不能算是个坏人，或许只能算是懦弱......","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"你大可恨我。","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"......","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"再见到那个孩子一面，也算了了我一桩心愿。","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"我会去见陛下......","id":60},{"type":"dialog","id":61},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":62},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":63},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":64},{"type":"charslot","id":65},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":66},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act13d0d0/m_sys_midautumn20.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":67,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":68},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":69},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你......都知道了？","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"就在刚刚......","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"我还想问你——","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你怎么......还能这么冷静......","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"只是一个在心里藏了很多年的猜想......终于被证实了。","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"就像扎在手心里的一根刺，拔掉了，流了血，也就好了。","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"你......","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"你怎么......不说话？","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我不知道......怎么会是这样......","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我该难过吗？还是该生气......？","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我不知道......我只是觉得脑子一团糟，心里堵得难受......我不知道这一肚子火到底该向谁发！","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"现在，是不是该我反过来问你了。","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"煌......你能不能告诉我，顾筌......我的父亲他，是个什么样的人？","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"他......他就是一个笨蛋，书呆子，说谎精！","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我讨厌说谎！我见过太多谎言，利欲熏心的谎言、懦弱的谎言、狡诈的谎言......","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"可我真的没见过......有人用一辈子去撒一个谎，还把自己的亲女儿弄丢了，把自己也弄丢了，就为了保护一个毫不相干的人......","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"他怎么......能这么笨。","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"我想起，以前在书上看过的一个故事......","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"从前有一个卫兵，守着江边的一所驿站。有一天，他注意到上游发了洪水，想要跑到上游，去提醒那里的人关闭水闸。","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"可是他跑到一半，发现江水涨得太急，想要关闸已经来不及了，便想立刻赶回下游的村庄，让那里的人赶快疏散。","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"这个人就这样来回跑着，直到最后他也葬身在这场洪水里，他什么都没能做到，谁也没有救下......","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"又说这些弯弯绕的......","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"你说......这个人做的事，听起来是不是很熟悉？","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我明白！虽然我搞不懂你说的弯弯绕绕的例子，但你在说他的坏话对不对？","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"他不是个坏人！他只是......唉！","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我知道，你当然有理由怨他，可是如果是他主动抛下了你，他又怎么会花这么多时间回来找你——","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"你怎么反而安慰起我来了......","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"煌......你是感染者，对吗？","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你什么时候知道——","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你这个人——是人精吧！","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"抱歉，我没有什么别的意思......我只是在想，这其实本应该是我的命运......","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你在胡说八道什么！","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你做错了什么事？有什么厄运需要你承担？","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我现在活得没什么不好的，有许多伙伴，找到了自己的理想......","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"而且，明明你过得很惨吧！一个人生活在深宅大院里，孤零零地长大就开心了？","id":125},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"我怎么觉得，你像是在骂我......","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我不是——","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"我明白......我明白的。","id":131},{"type":"dialog","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"对啦......我还没有问过，你到底叫什么名字？","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"烛煌......顾烛煌，我爸——是他给我起的名字。","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"哈......我都忘了有多久没和别人说过，我原来叫这个名字。","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"好了，这下我真的没有秘密了。","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"“萤烛之煌，微明可顾”......真像是他会取的名字。","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"煌......是不是到现在，我才算真正认识了你？","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"算......算是吧。","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"不对，我还有好多事没给你讲，我还要带你去维多利亚看看呢，我妈——应该说......你亲生母亲，你应该去见见她......","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"......她还活着？","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"谁告诉你她死了！她活得好好的，就在维多利亚西边一个小镇里。","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"等这边的事结束了，我就带你回去见她。","id":152},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"她......她一定很想见你......","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"好......好好......","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你哭什么？","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"我......我没有......","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"你才是，你干嘛也一副快要哭出来的表情......","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我就是......高兴。","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我哪能想到，长这么大了，我还能突然多一个妹妹。","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"哪里有这样的姐妹......","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"再说了，谁是妹妹还不一定呢。","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我今天这么难过，你就不能让让我？","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"你刚刚还安慰我来着......","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我就是想说......","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"从今往后，你就不是孤零零的一个人了，对吧？","id":176},{"type":"dialog","id":177},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":178},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":179},{"type":"charslot","id":180},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":181},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"唉......真好啊。","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#18$1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"世上百味，到底还是团圆的味道最好。","id":186},{"type":"dialog","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#11$1","id":188},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"真是......丢死人了，我跟着哭什么......","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#18$1","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"最后一桩心事，也算了啦。","id":192},{"type":"charslot","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"对了，昨天晚上，在禁城中的那位大理寺的官员......","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"惊蛰......","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"她送我出来的时候，被那个禁军小姑娘截住了。","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"我们现在该怎么办？","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这件事，还没结束......","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我要去，把原本该做的事做完。","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"你......你打算做什么？","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"......","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"为所有人......讨一个说法。","id":210},{"type":"dialog","id":211},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"2","id":212},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":213},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":214},{"type":"charslot","id":215},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_door","volume":"1","id":216},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":217},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wtchkgopenftstp","volume":"1","id":218},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":219},{"type":"text","text":"一百年了。","id":220},{"type":"text","text":"终于又回到了这里——棋局开始的地方。","id":221},{"type":"text","text":"棋盘结网蒙尘，天元上还留有一颗黑子。","id":222},{"type":"text","text":"他伸手拂去了棋盘上的灰。","id":223},{"type":"dialog","id":224},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gintcrturvive","volume":"1","id":225},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":226},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":227},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"6","id":228},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":229},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":230},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","y":"70","id":231},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":232},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":233},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#2$2","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":235},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1621_1#2$1","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"上哪去？","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$2","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"给人送饭去。","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1621_1#2$1","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"你人走了，这店就不管了？","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#2$2","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"都什么点了，早打烊了。","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1621_1#2$1","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"明天还开吗？","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#3$2","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"......明天开不开，那得看明天的心情，说不准的。","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1621_1#2$1","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"听你这意思，是要散伙了？","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1621_1#1$1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"行啊，你还欠我半年工钱，结了账就放你走。","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#11$2","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"嘁......怎么这么小气！给你做了那么多顿员工餐，就抵不过这几个月的债了......","id":254},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#14$2","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"行行行......后厨灶台右手边，从墙角往外数第三块砖，下面藏着我的最后一点零花钱。你拿去。","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1621_1#2$1","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"......","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"我跟了你不少年了。","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$2","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"是啊，整整十五年。在跟过我的那些秉烛人里，你算时间最久的，说明我们还是蛮有缘的嘛，哈哈。","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1621_1#2$1","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"要是我一直记得我还是司岁台的秉烛人，恐怕也跟不了你这么久。","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$2","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"唉，说实话，我也很多年没记起来我到底是谁了。","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"倒是没故意记得或者不记得，人也好兽也罢，就觉得这样活着，有滋有味，没什么不好。","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1621_1#2$1","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"那你最好永远不要记起来。","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"我怕你想起来自己是谁，反而忘了人的口味。舌头不好使了，这一手厨艺可就荒废了。","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#13$2","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"唉......我也不想啊。","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$2","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"可我总还记得，家里还有这些个不让人省心的哥哥姐姐，他们也是要吃饭的。","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"何况是最不让人放心的那位......也不知道这么久没见，他到底怎么样了。","id":274},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1621_1#2$1","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"你知道，今天去送了这一顿饭，是什么后果？","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#4$2","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"唔......应该知道吧。","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"就像灶火边上不能屯棉花，多自然的道理，司岁台当然不乐意让我们开家庭聚会了。","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"何况是这个节骨眼上......搞不好要是打起来，明天你可能就见不到我了。","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1621_1#10$1","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"......","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$2","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"唉......这些年，我做过许多饭，见了好多人。","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"我想让每一个走进这家店的客人，都能吃上好吃可口的饭，过的日子也都能圆满。","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#7$2","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"灶上的酸甜苦辣，心中的喜怒哀乐，世上的悲欢离合，多像同一回事呀。","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"可鲜鳞多刺，海棠无香，世上多的还是遗憾。","id":288},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$2","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"肚子饿了要吃饭，困了要睡觉......想念亲人了，也总是要去见见的。","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1621_1#10$1","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"你......你就真的舍得......","id":292},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#18$2","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"我还有好多舍不得的东西，可是再舍不得，也不能一直紧抓着不放手呀。","id":294},{"type":"dialog","id":295},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$2","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"老姜......我不在的时候，这家小饭馆能暂时拜托给你吗？","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"你看着我做了那么久的饭，我会做的菜，你应该也会个七七八八了吧。将来再有客人来，你就替我招呼招呼。","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#18$2","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"“余味居”......这名字起得倒是蛮好。","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"这人间，余味悠长啊。","id":302},{"type":"dialog","id":303},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":304},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"4","id":305},{"type":"backgroundtween","yFrom":"70","yTo":"-80","duration":"6","ease":"OutQuad","block":"false","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":307},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":308},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":309},{"type":"charslot","id":310},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","id":311},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":312},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"sn","id":313},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":314},{"type":"backgroundtween","yFrom":"-80","yTo":"0","duration":"6","ease":"OutQuad","block":"false","id":315},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":316},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":318},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":319},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1637_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":321},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1637_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡逻的卫兵","text":"报告校将，巡防营派出全部兵力，已经在八个城区进行了一轮地毯式的搜查，还是没发现目标。","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"已经过去一整天了......","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"天亮之前，必须——","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"听说你在找我？","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"何人？！","id":331},{"type":"dialog","id":332},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":333},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":334},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":335},{"type":"charslot","id":336},{"type":"background","id":337},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act23side/m_sys_act23side_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":338,"musicid":2},{"type":"image","image":"58_i13","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"0","id":339},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":340},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":341},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":342},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":343},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"让开。","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"怎么？现在是打算投案自首？","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"正好，也省得我到处找你。","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"不管你是因百珍宴上的事要抓我，还是因我的身份要抓我......现在都不是时候。","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我现在有要紧事要做，我劝你最好让开。","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"呵......","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我还从来没有这么生气过。你要是想拦我，大可试试。","id":351},{"type":"dialog","id":352},{"type":"playsound","key":"$firestorm","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"fire","id":353},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":354},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":355},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fire","fadetime":"6","id":356},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"啧......","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"......你到底想去做什么？","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我要去给真龙，送一碗长寿面。","id":360},{"type":"dialog","id":361},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":362},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":363},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":364},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":365},{"type":"charslot","id":366},{"type":"background","id":367},{"type":"image","id":368}],"characters":["宁述","虞澄","煌","宁茵","小大厨","老姜","余","巡逻的卫兵","“禁军小教头”","？？？"]}